    {
      "formula_id": "math:fourier-convolution-test-functions-proof:001",
      "source_latex": "\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:fourier-convolution-test-functions-proof}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{F}[\\phi*\\psi](\\bm{\\xi})\n&=(2\\pi)^{-m/2}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^m}e^{-i\\bm{\\xi}\\cdot\\bm{x}}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^m}\\phi(\\bm{x}-\\bm{y})\\psi(\\bm{y})\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{y}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\\\\n&=(2\\pi)^{-m/2}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^m}\\psi(\\bm{y})\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^m}e^{-i\\bm{\\xi}\\cdot\\bm{x}}\\phi(\\bm{x}-\\bm{y})\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{x}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{y}\\\\\n&=(2\\pi)^{-m/2}\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^m}\\psi(\\bm{y})\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^m}e^{-i\\bm{\\xi}\\cdot(\\bm{z}+\\bm{y})}\\phi(\\bm{z})\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{z}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{y}\\\\\n&=(2\\pi)^{m/2}\\mathcal{F}[\\phi](\\bm{\\xi})\\mathcal{F}[\\psi](\\bm{\\xi}).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\end{equation}",
      "kind": "display",
      "source_locations": [
        {
